<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Giao Dịch Thành Công</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-color: #2F80ED;
            --success-color: #27AE60;
            --text-color: #333;
            --light-text-color: #828282;
            --bg-color: #F2F2F2;
            --card-bg: #FFFFFF;
            --shadow: 0px 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro', sans-serif;
            background-color: var(--bg-color);
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        .container {
            background: var(--card-bg);
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            max-width: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            transform: scale(0.95);
            opacity: 0;
            animation: fadeInScale 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.165, 0.84, 0.44, 1) 0.2s forwards;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        @@keyframes fadeInScale {
            to {
                transform: scale(1);
                opacity: 1;
            }
        }

        /* Animated background gradient */
        .container::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: conic-gradient(
                transparent,
                rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1),
                transparent 30%
            );
            animation: rotate 10s linear infinite;
        }

        @@keyframes rotate {
            from { transform: rotate(0deg); }
            to { transform: rotate(360deg); }
        }

        .content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }

        .success-icon {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            margin: 0 auto 20px;
        }

        .success-icon .circle {
            stroke-dasharray: 1000;
            stroke-dashoffset: 1000;
            animation: draw 0.8s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.45, 1) forwards;
        }

        .success-icon .check {
            stroke-dasharray: 100;
            stroke-dashoffset: 100;
            animation: draw 0.6s cubic-bezier(0.65, 0, 0.45, 1) 0.5s forwards;
        }

        @@keyframes draw {
            to {
                stroke-dashoffset: 0;
            }
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--success-color);
            font-size: 2em;
            margin: 0 0 10px;
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        p.message {
            color: var(--light-text-color);
            font-size: 1em;
            line-height: 1.6;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .order-details {
            background-color: #F9F9F9;
            border: 1px dashed #E0E0E0;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .detail-item {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .detail-item:last-child {
            margin-bottom: 0;
        }

        .detail-label {
            color: var(--light-text-color);
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        .detail-value {
            color: var(--text-color);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-color) 0%, #3a9cff 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 14px 35px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 1em;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(47, 128, 237, 0.4);
        }

        .button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            box-shadow: 0 7px 20px rgba(47, 128, 237, 0.6);
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="content">
            <div class="success-icon">
                <svg version="1.1" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 130.2 130.2">
                    <circle class="circle" fill="none" stroke="#27AE60" stroke-width="6" stroke-miterlimit="10" cx="65.1" cy="65.1" r="62.1"/>
                    <polyline class="check" fill="none" stroke="#27AE60" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-miterlimit="10" points="100.2,40.2 51.5,88.8 29.8,67.5 "/>
                </svg>
            </div>
            <h1>Giao Dịch Thành Công</h1>
            <p class="message">Cảm ơn bạn đã hoàn tất thanh toán. Chúng tôi đã ghi nhận giao dịch của bạn.</p>

            <div class="order-details">
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Mã giao dịch:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">#15206148</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Số tiền:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">50.000 VNĐ</span>
                </div>
                <div class="detail-item">
                    <span class="detail-label">Thời gian:</span>
                    <span class="detail-value">16/10/2025</span>
                </div>
            </div>

            <a href="/" class="button">Hoàn Tất</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>